{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-kyocera","title":"创立京瓷","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/founding-kyocera","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-birth-of-kyocera","title":"京瓷的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/founding-kyocera/the-birth-of-kyocera","wordCount":1989,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"building-a-great-company","title":"缔造卓越的企业","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/kazuo-inamori/life-and-times/founding-kyocera/building-a-great-company","wordCount":2048,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"创立京瓷\">创立京瓷</h1><p>本章讲述稻盛和夫创立京瓷的历程。一九五九年，年仅二十七岁的稻盛和夫，创办了京都陶瓷株式会社。从一家仅有二十八人的小作坊起步，京瓷在稻盛和夫的带领下，凭借卓越的技术与深刻的经营哲学，逐步成长为享誉世界的卓越企业。两篇文档，分别呈现京瓷的诞生与缔造卓越企业的历程。</p>\n"}